<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITUS Bi</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Titus u siɓa yahudawa ɓa ama rii kirisa a ɔ̃ Bulus shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ au shɔ dɔranɛ au vishonɛ a nyaba Ɗa gɨnnɛ. <char style="bk" closed="false">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ Titus bi</char><char style="bk" closed="false">beeri sipɛ u shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ wujaa a kereti, shɔu shɔ yau a ɗɔu u ɔ̃ shɔ nopɔ̃nɛ a vishonɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa. Sẽkoou nwanya aru vi gaanɛ taati.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Au gaanɛ Titus kpariyi sisɨntɔ ruubii gbete yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗa i ɔ̃ a wuni, badijo aru karitiyayi ruubii kɔ̃linɛ. Au pɛsinɛ, Titus masiyibii nogbete i mati kopi kn shɔpiya vitɔ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, shopɛ̃niyi, supɛ̃niyi,(sho ai yɛ nogbete i mati jasɔroyi vitɔyɛ), jakasayi, a fooyi ni. Au yisinɛ, shɔ labeenɛm masi Titus bitɔ aru kirisa vishonɛ, badijo ayuu ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ a ɔ̃nɛ wesa, i yaa ruu zɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ, nyamasinɛ, a shɔyuvɔsinɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi Au Ɓuzɨn Yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yupɛ̃ni wɛrɛ Ɗayi (1.5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Vishonɛ kn tottot a wɛrɛ Ɗa (2.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bimasinɛ a yushogɔ̃nɛ (3.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (3.12-15)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Nkɔng Bulus Ɗalapa jawɛrɛ, Yesɔ Kirisi jashonɛ shɔu beerɔɔ sẽkoom yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Aru shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔnyɛ nɛ n masiyibii i sisɨn ãnɛ u lakitɔ fɛ̃ɛm, n pɔ̃siyinaa i zɛ vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɔgbete yɛ pɔ̃yirɛ i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa bassinɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Kɛɗɔn i yɛ ɔ̃ a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ shɔ suru gbete yisinyaɓayɛ. Ɗalapa shɔgbete yeenyaɓayɛ, u ɓɛɛ kotipi shɛshinɛ manɛ u shɔbiiyi i yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang awuni, <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Aɗagbete Ɗalapa lɔyɛ pɔ̃rɛ shɔu zɛ u nyaruubiitɔ, pɛ Ɗalapa shɔgbete rauyɛ ang u nyawaanɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨnrɛ nɛn nwari shɔtɔ.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />N beeri sẽkoom mɔkɔ Titus, n jaa tɔ̃vɨn a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ u a wuniyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeyɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ u shɔraanɛ u ãa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛtɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titus Vishonɛ a Kirit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />N yaa a Kirit aru a yisi vipɛlinɛ gbete au yaayɛ, wɔsɔ̃n a lɔ shɔpɛ̃ni sisɨn ãnɛyitɔ ko-pi komɔɔ shɔpiya. A kpaasisɨn a nya gbete n kɔsaayɛ nɛ: <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ shɔpɛ̃niu ɔ̃ shɔgbeteu ruukɔ̃linɛ ɓa yuuni ɓa; ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u so u ɔ̃ gbete shɛli, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɓɛɛjaayi u ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, shɔ ji pɔ̃yi ɓa nyaba sɔrɔni ɓa ko nɛyi gɨn shɔ nyaɓani ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Aruviya yupɛ̃ni sisɨn ãnɛ shɔ ãu Ɗalapa vishonɛ tɛttɔ naa, u ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteu ruukɔ̃linɛ ɓa ɗɔmɓa a kopiyani ɓa. Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ ɓa shɔ yulakinɛ ɓa, ko shɔ sisɨn tuunɛ tẽẽti ɓa, ko shɔ vikɔ̃linɛ ɓoonɛ ko shɔ bayusinɛ ɓa ko shɔ gbɔgbɔ saa ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Nɔgbete si pɛlinam ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete tɛ shɔ naatɔ au wɛrɛni, shɔu ɔri vigbete tɔ̃vɨntɔyɛ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ɔ̃ shɔgbete sãu yuutɔyɛ, shɔu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng-yɛ, u ɔ̃ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, wɔsɔ̃n shɔu gɔ̃u u yuu yushotɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Yupɛ̃ni sisɨn ãnɛ ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ãsisɨntɔ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn ni u sã a nakaziti nɔgbete shɔ matiuyɛ, a nyabankɔyɛ zɛnɔ shɔwɔyi bimasinɛtɔ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn matinɛni, wɔsɔ̃n u tasi ɗɔgbete shɔwɔyi i ji pɛli ɓa ntɔɓayɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Aruviya shɔ yulakinɛyi aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, badijo shɔ gbeteyi a kn shaa yeenɛmiyi, shɔ nyakɔ̃linɛ nwalinɛmiyi, shɔ gbeteyi ɗaki shɔ a ruugbete u gɨn-gɨn ɓayɛ nɛi ã sisɨn a ɗɔn. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ɔkɔɔ yaa shɔ ɗɔmiyi nɛ i mati shɔ vimrɛ, aruviya iyɛ gɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛmiyi yuurɛ piti kpai a vimatinɛ kɔ̃linɛmni, i pɛli viyusẽm aru i kpa saa kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Janyagadi shɔ Kirita ukɔ ma shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Kiritayi kopiɗaviya i ɓɛɛ jo shɔnyayeelinɛ, kɔ̃linɛ vivaayi, i yɔki shɔ ai shaa vi bang yɛ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Ruum pɛ nizɛ. Aruukɔ ɔ lasiyitɔ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨn a kɔrɔ ɔ zãriyitɔ a kakani, aru i ɔ̃kɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />nɔgbete i wesho tɔɓa a Yahudawayi ruuɓereni ɓa, a shɔzɛ nya-ãsinɛ au shɛ shɔgbeteyi bɛ̃ɛ̃ ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛyi nya ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Shɔgbeteu sisɨn wasak ko-iviya ɔ̃ji wɔsɔ- wɔsɔ au ɗɔbiini; ama shɔgbete i vi pɛlinɛ ɓa ntɔ ɓa a shɔ ã sisɨn ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa, i sisɨn ai vipɛlinɛni ɓa ntɔ ɓa. Pɛ nizɛ i lɛrinɛ ai sisɨn piti kpai ai sisɨn vishonɛni jo vi suɓɔ̃ng kɔ sheeli. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />I tasi yuu naa i zɛ Ɗalapatɛ ama i vipɛlinɛ i masinya a Ɗalapani. I vishonɛ ɓa tɔ̃ɓa, i gɨn Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛyi ɓa, i zɛnɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ɓa.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Vitɔvɨng Au Shɔ Mati yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ama ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a ɔkɔrɔɔ a mati sho vitɔ̃vɨng au tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />A mati shɔpɛ̃ni vɔshɔyi i sãi yuutɔ, i ɔ̃ a sẽrẽni, i ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn, a ɔrinɛ, a sisɨn mɛnɛni. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Sɔ̃n ji nankɔ a mati supɛ̃niyi vi i ɔ̃ jo ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn naa soro gbete i ã yuu a vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn i ɔ̃yɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ. Ɓa shɔ gbeteyi lɛsi shɔ niiyɛ ɓa, ko ikɔ ã yuunɛ a mii inabini bang. Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng ɔkɔrɔɔ i mati shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Nɔgbete i mati jasoroyiyɛ, nɛi ɔri ɓɛvɔyitɔ a ɓɛɛjaayini <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />i ɔ̃ shɔ yuu sãnɛ, shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, su tɔ̃vɨn ayi sãyi wɛrɛtɔyɛ, gbeteyi ãyuutɔ a ɓɛvɔyi biini, nɔgbete shɔwɔ yɛ nwaruu kɔ̃linɛ dɔɔɓa a ruu gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiini ɓa.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Sɔ̃n ji nyabankɔ ɔ geli jakasayi i sãi yuutɔ. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔɔ a pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng a vi piti kpai u ɔ̃ vitasinɛ. A vigbete a mati shɔ yɛ a ãyuutɔ a ɔ̃ shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn shanɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />A pɛlivishonɛ a ruu gbete nya taɓa aɗɔn ɓa, nɔgbete a ã a shɔnɔpɔ̃yi yusẽyɛ, i kpa vikɔ̃linɛ ai sha aa yuuni ɓa.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />A mati fooyitɔ i ã yuu ai shɔwɛrɛyi biini, a vi piti a gakiyitɔ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔɔ i kpeli i shɔwɛrɛyi nyaɓa. <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />ko viɓɔɔnɛ i ɓɔɔ ɓa, nɔgbeteyi si pɛlinam, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔɔ kopiɗaviya i tasinɛi pɛ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, nɛi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, nɔgbete a vi gbete i pɛliyɛ kpai shɔ zɛ vi gbete shɔ mati a nyaba Ɗalapa u shɔ shɔraanɛ kn kiriri.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Aru Ɗalapa tasiu raantanɛtɛ, a nyaba gbete kã shɔzɛ raanɛ kpai yɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Aru tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ matiu nɛu yaa vishonɛ a Ɗalapa nta tɔ̃vɨn ɓa awuni ɓayɛ, a vigbete shɔgbeteyi ji ãsisɨn ɓa i kasiyɛnitɔ, u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ yuu sãnɛ, u ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a sisɨn, u tasi ɔ̃nɛ Ɗalapa a kotipimni, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />u ɗɔgbete u ga lee Ɗa susãri tasinɛ bi yɛ ayɛ, aɗagbete u basiu Ɗalapa au ɓɛjaa Yesɔ Kirisi shɔ-shɔ raanɛ yɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Yesɔ kɔ ãu yuurɛ a vɔrɛ au yuuni, aru u raau a ruuvini ni kpai u pɔ̃urɛ u ɔ̃ u shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, badijo shɔ gbeteyi sisɨn vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ ɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />A mati shɔ vim a kakani a masaa shɔ ntanɛyi bitɔ a gɔ̃yi yushotɔ. Mɔkɔ yaa shɔwɔnɛ u kanɔɔnɛrɛ a mɔkɔni.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisa Ɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />A kpari a shɔbiiyi sisɨn i ãyuutɔ a yupɛ̃niyi a kpatiyini, i gɨyi nyatɔ, i mabiitɔ aru vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ kopinyaba shɔpiya. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />A geliyitɔ ikɔyi nwanya kɔ̃linɛ nɛ a shɔwɔ yuuni, ama i ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ a shɔ gãsiyini, i ɔ̃ sɔ̃n shɔ wesa sãnɛ a kopiyani, a kopiɗaviya i tasi kopiya ɔ̃nɛ yuuroorinɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Aruviya si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ u si pɛ rãng-yi, u gɨn Ɗalapa nya ɓa, shɔ ɗakiurɛ, u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ fooyi a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a vi kasinɛ. Au ɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ gɨnkanɛ a zɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ a sisɨn; shɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃urɛ, ukɔma u bɛ̃ɛ̃yi rɛjo. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Ama aɗagbete shɔ tasi Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔrinɛ Ɗalapa u raanɛyɛ, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />Ɗalapa raaurɛ. Si ɓa ruu vitɔ̃vɨng gbete u pɛli au yuuyɛ ɓa, ama aru gbete ntau raayɛ a raaurɛ nyaba gbete sɔɔu a Ɗa suru, shɔu ãu yeenɛ sɔɔ a suru sɔɔni. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Ɗalapa ãu Ɗa suru weze ɗɔkɔkɔ au yuu a nyaba Yesɔ kirisi u shɔraanɛ, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />pɛli nankɔ aru u kpa Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ nɔgbete u kpa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, u ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi kpa suru gbete yisinyaɓayɛ au pɔ̃ sisɨn aɗɔnyɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Ruum nyamasinɛ ɓa pɛ nizɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">N kasirɛ a ã kaka tɔ a ruumni fɛ̃ɛm, nɔgbete shɔgbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗalapa biyɛni, i yɔriyuu kn i pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng, vimiyi pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, i vishonɛ a kopiya ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Ama a yaa nya kɔ̃linɛ nwalinɛtɔ, a mɛuruuyi nii dãnɛ ni, a shɔ yuu vɔsinɛ, a bawaanɛ ayuu Musa nyaãsinɛ. I ɓa vishonɛ tɔ̃ ɓa, i sɔ̃n vikɔ̃linɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Gɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi vɔsi shɔ yuuyɛ yushotɔ a geliunɛ u yaatɔ ko ɓa ziti, kɛɗɔn a yaaurɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />A zɛtɛ zɔng shɔ ɗɔmiyi lɛsi tɛttɔ, i ruuvini tasi tɛttɔ nɛi ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓa.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakonɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />N kɛ sho Artima ko Taikiku nɛ aa ɗɔbii, a pɛli nɔgbete a pɛliyɛ a ang ɗɔbii a Nikafoli, aruviya n kasi goosi pɛlinɛ aɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />A pɛli nɔgbete a pɛliyɛ a pɔ̃si Zena lauyam naa a Apolo i sã nyaba yɛnɛtɔ, a zɛ pɛtɔ vigbeteyi kasiyɛ aɗɔn kpai. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔɔ u shɔbiiyi i mati nɔgbeteyi pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng-yɛ ai ɔ̃nɛni, nɔgbteyi ã vitɔ̃vɨng a shɔ kasiyɛ, ikɔyi ɔ̃nɛ ɔ̃nɛ vishonɛ ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Shɔ gbeteyi a nkɔni i gee a nyatɛ kpai. A gee u shɔbiiyi nyatɔ. Ɗa shonɛ tɔ̃vɨn u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>